解き放て 今 僕らが起こした火を
Unleash now, the fire that we started,

164
00:19:02,469 --> 00:19:07,869
舞い上げ 走れば 明日が変わるはず
soaring, running, I believe we can change tomorrow!

165
00:19:07,869 --> 00:19:13,169
君がいたこの世界 もう一度愛せるまで
Until I can love this world you were in once more,

166
00:19:13,169 --> 00:19:18,469
我が命 果てようとも 繋げていくよ
even if my life comes to an end, I'll keep holding it together...

167
00:19:18,469 --> 00:19:24,669
絆が紡いで生まれた奇跡を
This miracle born from our bonds!

168
00:20:02,093 --> 00:20:07,093
ブルーアンバー
[Title: Blue Amber]

169
00:20:08,493 --> 00:20:11,393
抱きしめられた記憶から
From the memories of being embraced...

170
00:20:11,393 --> 00:20:15,293
流れ出てた赤い雫
...red droplets flowed.

171
00:20:15,893 --> 00:20:20,293
人様に見せるものじゃないの
These are not to be seen by others.

172
00:20:20,893 --> 00:20:23,393
伝えなかった言霊
The unspoken words...

173
00:20:23,393 --> 00:20:26,893
もうひとつの私になって
...became another me.

174
00:20:27,093 --> 00:20:29,593
身体の内側で
Inside my body...

175
00:20:29,593 --> 00:20:32,393
何かを叫んでる
...something is screaming.

176
00:20:33,093 --> 00:20:35,593
欲しかったのに
Even though I wanted it...

177
00:20:35,593 --> 00:20:38,393
悔しかったのに
...even though I regretted it.

178
00:20:38,793 --> 00:20:40,093
駄目だよ
I can't...

179
00:20:40,093 --> 00:20:42,693
全部隠しておくの
...hide it all.

180
00:20:42,693 --> 00:20:44,893
ごめんね
I'm sorry.

181
00:20:45,093 --> 00:20:48,293
悲しいのは一人で
Because being sad alone...

182
00:20:48,293 --> 00:20:51,293
十分だからと
...is enough.

183
00:20:51,293 --> 00:20:54,293
これ以上醜く
I don't want to become...

184
00:20:54,293 --> 00:20:57,193
なりたくないのと
...any uglier than this.

185
00:20:57,193 --> 00:21:00,393
私の中で誰にも
Without anyone noticing...

186
00:21:00,393 --> 00:21:03,393
見付けられずに
...inside me.

187
00:21:03,393 --> 00:21:06,293
こんな色になるまで
I cried until I turned this color...

188
00:21:06,293 --> 00:21:08,093
泣いていたんだね
...didn't I?

189
00:21:08,093 --> 00:21:09,893
綺麗よ
You're beautiful.

190
00:21:23,093 --> 00:21:25,893
渡しそびれた心から
From the heart I failed to give...

191
00:21:25,893 --> 00:21:29,693
流れ出た青い雫
...blue droplets flowed.

192
00:21:29,693 --> 00:21:35,093
人様に浴びせるものじゃないの
These are not to be poured on others.

193
00:21:35,193 --> 00:21:38,393
余すところなく飲み込んで
Swallowing it all without leaving any behind...

194
00:21:38,393 --> 00:21:41,693
遠くの海の底に沈んで
...sinking to the bottom of a distant sea.

195
00:21:41,693 --> 00:21:44,893
そのまま宝石にでも
I'll wait to become a jewel...

196
00:21:44,893 --> 00:21:47,893
なれるのを待つわ
...as I am.

197
00:22:00,393 --> 00:22:02,893
本当を嘘で飾って
Decorating truth with lies...

198
00:22:02,893 --> 00:22:06,393
ごっこみたいな暮らしで慰めて
...comforting with a pretend life.

199
00:22:06,393 --> 00:22:09,293
誰かの悲劇で
Healing my own tragedy...

200
00:22:09,293 --> 00:22:12,393
自分の悲劇を癒して
...with someone else's tragedy.

201
00:22:12,893 --> 00:22:16,193
愛しさに溺れた
In the moment of drowning...

202
00:22:16,193 --> 00:22:19,193
瞬間のままで
...in longing,

203
00:22:19,193 --> 00:22:21,393
息も出来ず
without being able to breathe...

204
00:22:21,393 --> 00:22:24,393
ただ愛してるの
...just loving you.

205
00:22:25,593 --> 00:22:28,393
悲しいのは一人で
Because being sad alone...

206
00:22:28,393 --> 00:22:31,293
十分だからと
...is enough.

207
00:22:31,293 --> 00:22:34,293
これ以上醜く
I don't want to become...

208
00:22:34,293 --> 00:22:37,193
なりたくないのと
...any uglier than this.

209
00:22:37,193 --> 00:22:40,093
私の中で誰にも
Without anyone noticing...

210
00:22:40,093 --> 00:22:43,093
見付けられずに
...inside me.

211
00:22:43,093 --> 00:22:46,093
こんな色になるまで
I cried until I turned this color...

212
00:22:46,093 --> 00:22:49,193
泣いていたんだね
...didn't I?

213
00:22:49,193 --> 00:22:51,893
綺麗よ
You're beautiful.

214
00:22:55,093 --> 00:22:58,093
ごめんね
I'm sorry.

215
00:23:00,593 --> 00:23:02,093
ねぇ
Hey...

216
00:23:02,093 --> 00:23:06,093
綺麗よ
...you're beautiful.

217
00:23:49,093 --> 00:23:52,093
片っぽで丸を作って
Making a loop with one end...

218
00:23:52,093 --> 00:23:55,093
しっかり持ってて
...hold it tightly.

219
00:23:55,093 --> 00:23:58,893
もう片っぽでその丸の後ろを
And with the other end...

220
00:23:58,893 --> 00:24:01,893
ぐるっと回って
...wrap it around the back of that loop.

221
00:24:02,093 --> 00:24:05,893
間にできたポッケに入って
Go into the pocket made in between...

222
00:24:05,893 --> 00:24:08,893
出て来るの待ってて
...and wait for it to come out.

223
00:24:08,893 --> 00:24:12,393
出てきたところを迎えにきて
Come to greet where it comes out...

224
00:24:12,393 --> 00:24:15,393
「せーの」で引っ張って
...and pull it on three.

225
00:24:16,193 --> 00:24:18,693
はじめてはなんとも
Even if at first...

226
00:25:10,219 --> 00:25:17,119
片っぽでも引っ張っちゃえば ほどけちゃうけど
If you pull even one end, it will untie,

227
00:25:17,119 --> 00:25:22,819
作ったもの壊すのは 遥かに簡単だけど
destroying what you made is far easier.

228
00:25:22,819 --> 00:25:30,219
だけどほどく時も そうちゃんと 同じようにね
But even when untying it, do it just the same way, right?

229
00:25:30,219 --> 00:25:37,319
分かってるよ でもできたらね 「せーの」で引っ張って
I know, but if you can, pull it on one, two...

230
00:25:37,319 --> 00:25:44,019
ほどけやしないように と願って 力込めては
Praying that it won't untie, putting effort into it,

231
00:25:44,019 --> 00:25:52,819
広げすぎた羽根に 戸惑う
I'm bewildered by the wings spread too wide.

232
00:25:54,119 --> 00:26:00,619
羽根は大きく 結び目は固く
So that the wings are large and the knot is firm,

233
00:26:00,619 --> 00:26:07,319
なるようにきつく 結んでいてほしいの
I want you to tie it tightly.

234
00:26:07,319 --> 00:26:11,319
夢はここに 思い出は遠くに
I want your dreams here and your memories far away,

235
00:26:11,319 --> 00:26:23,819
気付けばそこにある くらいがいい
close enough to notice when you touch them.

236
00:26:24,019 --> 00:26:30,819
黙って引っ張ったりしないでよ 不格好な蝶にしないでよ
Don't just pull it silently, don't make it an ugly butterfly.

237
00:26:30,819 --> 00:26:37,819
結んだつもりが ほどいていたり 緩めたつもりが 締めていたり
Thinking you tied it only to find it untied, thinking you loosened it only to find it tightened.

238
00:27:02,419 --> 00:27:10,219
この蒼くて広い世界に 無数に散らばった中から
From the countless scattered things in this vast, blue world,

239
00:27:10,219 --> 00:27:16,819
別々に二人選んだ糸を お互いたぐり寄せ合ったんだ
the two of us pulled towards each other the threads we chose separately.

240
00:27:16,819 --> 00:27:23,319
結ばれたんじゃなく結んだんだ 二人で「せーの」で引っ張ったんだ
We didn't just happen to be tied, we tied them together, and pulled them together on one, two.

241
00:27:23,319 --> 00:27:30,219
大きくも小さくもなりすぎないように 力を込めたんだ
We put our strength into it so it wouldn't become too big or too small.

242
00:27:30,219 --> 00:27:37,319
この蒼くて広い世界に 無数に散らばった中から
From the countless scattered things in this vast, blue world,

243
00:27:37,319 --> 00:27:43,819
別々に二人選んだ糸を お互いたぐり寄せ合ったんだ
the two of us pulled towards each other the threads we chose separately.

244
00:27:43,819 --> 00:27:50,419
結ばれたんじゃなく結んだんだ 二人で「せーの」で引っ張ったんだ
We didn't just happen to be tied, we tied them together, and pulled them together on one, two.

245
00:27:50,419 --> 00:27:57,419
大きくも小さくもなりすぎないように 力を込めたんだ
We put our strength into it so it wouldn't become too big or too small.

246
00:28:47,019 --> 00:28:54,319
花になって
[Song: Becoming a Flower]

247
00:28:58,019 --> 00:29:02,619
陰にそっと隠れようが いいんじゃない？
It's okay to quietly hide in the shadows.

248
00:29:02,619 --> 00:29:07,319
蕾のような花だって あるんじゃない
Even if you're a flower like a bud.

249
00:29:07,919 --> 00:29:12,319
秘密にして守るのが いいんじゃない
It's good to keep it a secret.

250
00:29:12,319 --> 00:29:17,619
誰にも邪魔されず 華麗に咲いてる
Bloom beautifully without bothering anyone.

251
00:29:17,919 --> 00:29:20,419
甘い 苦いにハマんない
Not too sweet, not too bitter...

252
00:29:20,419 --> 00:29:22,919
その判断が下んない
That judgment is unreliable.

253
00:29:22,919 --> 00:29:27,819
気に病んで下を向かないでいて
Don't turn your back on what you've been through.

254
00:29:27,919 --> 00:29:30,419
愛に慣れちゃいない
Can't become love,

255
00:29:30,419 --> 00:29:32,919
無駄に飾らない
won't need to pretend.

256
00:29:32,919 --> 00:29:35,419
綺麗にされた花瓶も<
Don't need a beautifully arranged vase

257
00:29:35,419 --> 00:29:37,919
肥やしも何もいらない
or a cage.

258
00:29:37,919 --> 00:29:41,819
その姿が美しい
Your figure is beautiful.

259
00:29:42,019 --> 00:29:44,319
花になって
Becoming a flower...

260
00:29:44,319 --> 00:29:47,819
ほらニヒルに笑って
Bloom in the sun.

261
00:29:47,819 --> 00:29:51,819
その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない
I can't take my eyes off your face.

262
00:29:51,819 --> 00:29:54,319
味見して
Tasting...

263
00:29:54,319 --> 00:29:58,019
君の毒は私の薬って
your poison is my medicine.

264
00:29:58,019 --> 00:30:00,819
包んであげるから
I'll wrap you up...

265
00:30:00,464 --> 00:30:02,564
て 笑って
...so smile.

266
00:30:07,564 --> 00:30:11,264
ねぇ 会いたい 会いたい そう
Hey, I want to see you, I want to meet you, yes...

267
00:30:11,264 --> 00:30:13,964
その笑顔に 会いたい 会いたい
...I want to see that smile of yours, I want to meet you.

268
00:30:13,264 --> 00:30:17,464
って言えば笑ってくれるかな
If I say that, will you smile for me?

269
00:30:17,764 --> 00:30:21,464
陰から支えるくらいはいいんじゃない？
It's okay to support from the shadows, right?

270
00:30:22,264 --> 00:30:27,564
欲を言えばこの手で咲かせてみせたい
If I dare to wish, I want to make you bloom with these hands.

271
00:30:28,164 --> 00:30:31,264
病のように
Like an illness...

272
00:30:31,264 --> 00:30:34,264
心を喰らう花
...a flower that consumes the heart...

273
00:30:34,264 --> 00:30:37,764
枯らしたくないのさ
...I don't want it to wither.

274
00:30:40,164 --> 00:30:44,264
光が届かずとも
Even if the light doesn't reach...

275
00:30:44,664 --> 00:30:49,464
水をあげ続けるから
...I'll keep giving you water.

276
00:30:52,464 --> 00:30:55,664
いい加減に気付いて 君は素敵って
Realize it already, you're wonderful...

277
00:30:55,664 --> 00:30:58,664
自惚れてもっと お大事に
...be more precious, even if you're conceited.

278
00:31:03,664 --> 00:31:07,964
無自覚なまんま 愛を蓄えて
Unconsciously storing up love.

279
00:31:08,564 --> 00:31:10,364
綺麗にされた花瓶も
No need for a beautifully arranged vase...

280
00:31:10,364 --> 00:31:12,764
肥やしも何もいらない
...or fertilizer.

281
00:31:12,764 --> 00:31:17,764
その姿で咲き誇れ
Bloom proudly in that form!

282
00:31:18,864 --> 00:31:21,464
花になって
Become a flower!

283
00:31:22,264 --> 00:31:24,864
ほらニヒルに笑って
Come on, smile nihilistically.

284
00:31:24,864 --> 00:31:29,764
その顔にぞくぞくして目が離せない
Your face is so captivating, I can't look away.

285
00:31:29,764 --> 00:31:32,364
味見して
Taste it...

286
00:31:32,364 --> 00:31:35,764
君の毒は私の薬って
...your poison is my remedy...

287
00:31:35,764 --> 00:31:38,664
包んであげるから
...I'll wrap it up for you.

288
00:31:38,964 --> 00:31:42,564
楽にして
Relax...

289
00:31:42,564 --> 00:31:45,964
君の闇は私の光って
...your darkness is my light...

290
00:31:45,964 --> 00:31:49,664
愛してあげるから 笑って
...I'll love you, so smile.

291
00:32:09,464 --> 00:32:13,464
ドライフラワー
Dry Flower

292
00:32:22,464 --> 00:32:25,964
多分、私じゃなくていいね
Maybe I'm not the one you were looking for.

293
00:32:25,964 --> 00:32:29,264
余裕のない二人だったし
We couldn't afford to love each other anymore.

294
00:32:29,264 --> 00:32:34,964
気付けば喧嘩ばっかりしてさ ごめんね
We ended up fighting all the time. I'm sorry.

295
00:32:35,464 --> 00:32:38,564
ずっと話そうと思ってた
I've been meaning to tell you for a while.

296
00:32:38,564 --> 00:32:41,664
きっと私たち合わないね
We're just not right for each other.

297
00:32:41,664 --> 00:32:44,964
二人きりしかいない部屋でさ
In that room where there were only the two of us,

298
00:32:44,964 --> 00:32:48,264
貴方ばかり話していたよね
you did all the talking, didn't you?

299
00:32:48,464 --> 00:32:53,764
もし何時か何処かで会えたら
If we ever meet again somewhere down the road,

300
00:32:53,764 --> 00:33:00,264
今日の事を笑ってくれるかな
I wonder if you'll laugh about today.

301
00:33:00,764 --> 00:33:06,464
理由もちゃんと話せないけれど
I can't quite explain the reasons why,

302
00:33:06,764 --> 00:33:13,664
貴方が眠った後に泣くのは嫌
but I hate crying after you fall asleep.

303
00:33:13,964 --> 00:33:17,764
声も 顔も
Your voice, your face...

304
00:33:17,764 --> 00:33:20,864
不器用なとこも
...even your clumsy ways...

305
00:33:20,864 --> 00:33:23,664
全部全部
...every single thing...

306
00:33:23,664 --> 00:33:26,964
嫌いじゃないの
...I just can't bring myself to hate them.

307
00:33:26,964 --> 00:33:30,464
ドライフラワーみたい 君の日々も
Like dried flowers, our days together...

308
00:33:30,464 --> 00:33:37,864
きっときっときっときっと
...surely, surely, surely...

309
00:33:37,864 --> 00:33:41,664
色褪せる
...will fade away.

310
00:33:56,964 --> 00:34:00,264
多分、君じゃなくてよかった
Maybe it's for the best that it wasn't you.

311
00:34:00,264 --> 00:34:03,564
もう泣かされることもないし
You can't make me cry anymore,

312
00:34:03,564 --> 00:34:08,964
「私ばかり」なんて言葉も なくなった slums
and I no longer complain that "it's always me."

313
00:34:09,464 --> 00:34:12,764
あんなに悲しい別れでも
Even a breakup as painful as that one...

314
00:34:12,764 --> 00:34:15,964
時間がたてば忘れてく
...gradually fades as time goes by.

315
00:34:15,964 --> 00:34:19,764
新しい人と並ぶ君は
Seeing you standing next to someone new,

316
00:34:19,764 --> 00:34:22,464
ちゃんと上手くやれているのかな slag
I wonder if you're treating them right.

317
00:34:22,464 --> 00:34:24,864
もう顔も見たくないからさ
I don't ever want to see your face again,

318
00:34:24,864 --> 00:34:28,164
変に連絡してこないでほしい
so please stop sending me these awkward texts.

319
00:34:34,964 --> 00:34:38,264
都合がいいのは
You only contact me when it's convenient,

320
00:34:38,264 --> 00:34:41,464
変わってないんだね
you haven't changed a bit, have you?

321
00:34:41,464 --> 00:34:44,664
デモ無視できずに
But even so, I can't ignore you,

322
00:34:44,664 --> 00:34:48,264
また少し返事
and find myself replying to you again.

323
00:34:48,464 --> 00:34:51,764
声も 顔も
Your voice, your face...

324
00:34:51,764 --> 00:34:54,964
不器用なとこも 多分今も
...even your clumsy ways, maybe even now...

325
00:34:54,964 --> 00:35:00,464
嫌いじゃないの
...I still can't bring myself to hate them.

326
00:35:01,958 --> 00:35:04,458
...ドライフラワーみたいに
...like a dry flower,

327
00:35:04,758 --> 00:35:07,758
時間が経てば
as time passes,

328
00:35:07,758 --> 00:35:10,158
きっと きっと
surely, surely,

329
00:35:10,158 --> 00:35:12,458
きっと きっと
surely, surely...

330
00:35:12,458 --> 00:35:16,958
色褪せる
will fade away.

331
00:35:28,158 --> 00:35:31,758
月灯りに魔物が揺れる
Monsters sway in the moonlight.

332
00:35:31,758 --> 00:35:34,758
きっと私もどうかしてる
I'm probably losing my mind, too.

333
00:35:34,758 --> 00:35:40,758
暗闇に色彩が浮かぶ
Colors float in the darkness.

334
00:35:40,958 --> 00:35:44,458
赤黄青色が胸の奥
Red, yellow, and blue deep in my heart...

335
00:35:44,458 --> 00:35:47,458
ずっと貴方の名前を呼ぶ
I keep calling your name.

336
00:35:47,458 --> 00:35:50,458
好きという気持ち
The feeling of love

337
00:35:50,458 --> 00:35:52,958
また香る
is fragrant once again.

338
00:35:53,158 --> 00:35:55,558
声も
Your voice,

339
00:35:55,558 --> 00:35:57,158
顔も
your face,

340
00:35:57,158 --> 00:35:59,458
不器用なとこも
even your awkward side...

341
00:35:59,458 --> 00:36:01,958
全部 全部
I hate them all, all...

342
00:36:01,958 --> 00:36:05,458
大嫌いだよ
I hate them so much.

343
00:36:05,958 --> 00:36:09,458
まだ枯れない花を
Still holding onto a flower

344
00:36:09,458 --> 00:36:12,458
君に添えてさ
that won't wither for you,

345
00:36:12,458 --> 00:36:17,458
ずっと ずっと ずっと ずっと
forever, forever, forever, forever,

346
00:36:17,458 --> 00:36:20,458
抱えてよ
please embrace it.

347
00:36:20,458 --> 00:36:27,458
あぁ あぁ...
Ah, ah...

348
00:37:11,458 --> 00:37:16,958
二人三脚 feat. 猫汰つな
[Three-Legged Race feat. Nekomata Tsuna]

349
00:37:17,458 --> 00:37:22,958
大丈夫と
"I'm okay,"

350
00:37:23,958 --> 00:37:29,458
また嘘をついた
I lied once again.

351
00:37:30,158 --> 00:37:34,458
無理してるの
"You're pushing yourself..."

352
00:37:34,958 --> 00:37:37,758
声でわかるよ
I can tell by your voice.

353
00:37:37,958 --> 00:37:40,758
バレてるんだよ
I've seen right through you.

354
00:37:50,158 --> 00:37:56,158
見た目だとか性格だって違うあなた
You are so different, from looks to personality,

355
00:37:56,158 --> 00:38:02,158
だけど似てるとこも意外とあって
but we're unexpectedly alike in some ways.

356
00:38:02,458 --> 00:38:05,458
共鳴 すぐにしたんだ
We resonated with each other instantly,

357
00:38:05,458 --> 00:38:09,458
惹かれ合った私たち
we who were drawn together.

358
00:38:09,458 --> 00:38:12,958
不思議なこの絆
This mysterious bond...

359
00:38:12,958 --> 00:38:15,758
なんだか照れくさくて
It's somehow a bit embarrassing,

360
00:38:15,758 --> 00:38:17,458
引き合うの
drawing us closer.

361
00:38:17,458 --> 00:38:19,458
手をつなごう
Let's hold hands.

362
00:38:19,458 --> 00:38:22,458
私がね 頑張れる理由
The reason why I can do my best...

363
00:38:22,458 --> 00:38:23,758
そう
...is that, yes,

364
00:38:23,758 --> 00:38:29,458
一人じゃないから
I am not alone.

365
00:38:29,458 --> 00:38:35,158
あなたが笑えば 私もつられる
When you smile, I can't help but smile too.

366
00:38:35,158 --> 00:38:41,758
しあわせの心 連鎖してるよ
Our happy hearts are linking together.

367
00:38:41,758 --> 00:38:47,758
時には歩幅が ズレてしまうけど
Sometimes our steps might fall out of sync,

368
00:38:47,758 --> 00:38:49,958
二人
