370
00:38:51,958 --> 00:38:57,158
未来へと 進んで行こう
...let's step forward into the future!

371
00:38:57,158 --> 00:39:00,158
どれくらいの位置にいんのかな
I wonder where we are positioned right now,

372
00:39:00,158 --> 00:39:03,158
周りと比べて
compared to everyone else.

373
00:39:03,158 --> 00:39:08,458
果てしないトラック線上 追いつけるの？
Can we catch up on this endless track?

374
00:39:08,458 --> 00:39:09,458
なんて
Thinking like that...

375
00:39:09,458 --> 00:39:15,958
弱気な日も 励まし続けてくれた
...even on my weak days, you kept encouraging me.

376
00:39:15,958 --> 00:39:19,758
あなたにいつも感謝
I'm always so grateful to you.

377
00:39:19,758 --> 00:39:22,158
転んでも立ち上がる
Even if we fall, we will rise again,

378
00:39:22,158 --> 00:39:25,458
夢を叶えたいんだ
because we want to make our dreams come true.

379
00:39:25,458 --> 00:39:29,458
こんなにね 打ち込めるのは
The reason I can devote myself this much...

380
00:39:29,458 --> 00:39:30,158
そう
